  "intent": {
    "text": "Seize IRON BRIDGE (E5) intact and establish a bridgehead at E6 by T+20 so the brigade can cross at T+25. Preserve combat power for the crossing. Do not get drawn west into the marsh (A6). If cut off, act to keep the bridge intact and the crossing site open.",
